# Vercel CLI's project link (project + org ID). Created at the repo root when
# `vercel link` is run from here, which is where it must be run: the project's
# Root Directory is `frontend`, so the CLI has to upload from the level above it
# for a CLI deploy to resolve the same paths a git-push deploy does.
#
# frontend/.gitignore already ignores its own `.vercel`; this covers the root
# one, which nothing else did.
.vercel
